/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (A good software process model must be clear and understandable by the whole team. It should be flexible enough to adapt to changes without disrupting the entire workflow. It must be measurable so teams can track progress at every stage. It should support communication between developers, managers, and clients. Finally it must be repeatable so the same process can be applied across different projects and still produce consistent and reliable results.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
