602 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 396 0 R
/E (The Inception phase is the initial stage of the Rational Unified Process where the project's business case, scope, and feasibility are established. It involves identifying key stakeholders, defining the project's vision, estimating costs and schedules, and conducting an initial risk assessment.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 396 0 R
/T (Elaboration Phase)
/E (Elaboration Phase)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 396 0 R
/E (The Elaboration phase is the second stage of the Rational Unified Process where the system's architecture is defined, analyzed, and validated. This phase focuses on capturing a majority of the system requirements, mitigating high-risk technical and project risks, and building a prototype or proof-of-concept to test critical components.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
